{%- comment -%}
  NF-BULK-ORDER (2026-09-14): the product table of the bulk order form (/pages/bulk-order-form). Rendered in the context of
  an industry page through the Section Rendering API (/pages/<industry page>?section_id=nf-bulk-table) and loaded by
  assets/nf-bulk-order.js. The list is the page metafield custom.bulk_products (list.product_reference), seeded from the
  products each industry page already features. To change a list: Shopify admin, Online Store, Pages, the industry page,
  Metafields, "Bulk order products".
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'nf-bulk-rows', items: page.metafields.custom.bulk_products.value -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "NF bulk order table",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
